death behavior earned one small reusable physical consequence, bearingBurst(origin,count), shared by
Jumper and Floater. Creature health/death architecture remains deliberately unpromoted.

WORLD LAB SEMANTIC DELTA — 3D · WORKS T0.19
FLOATER EGG adds a sibling autonomous target without promoting a creature/combat framework. Distinct
death consequences now compose with existing world semantics: Crawler destruction removes terrain;
Floater destruction releases ordinary bearings. Per-payload durability remains local evidence.

WORLD LAB SEMANTIC DELTA — 3D · WORKS T0.17
ENTITY-LEVEL SEMANTIC FORWARD: live entities now carry canonical local +Z forward. Directional
payload geometry and behavior consume that shared positional semantic; turret targeting no longer
contains a compensating PI sign hack. This is intentionally a seed convention, not a direction framework.
*/
/*
