The E6 wonder field is preserved intact as a separate toggleable possibility probe. A new surface-civilization inspection field is added without replacing canonical payloads. Function-first brass/glass/timber structures test intake, sorting, fabrication, buffering, waterworks, habitation, interchange, relays and civilization-styled readings of existing machine propositions. Hollow process volumes visibly accept variable granular fill as an architectural probe; this does not yet claim authoritative bearing storage semantics.
*/
